This directory contains scripts which implement some of NIST's QCSim
bencharmks.  All of these simulations use the density matrix
representation.  Please see our related paper which can be found at
http://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0403114

The functionality of the circuits simulated is courtesy of Andrew Lane
and Paul E. Black of NIST.

Scripts
-------

steaneX.qpro: Simulates the influence and detection of probabilisitc
	      bit-flip errors on a mixed density state encoded with
	      the Steane 7-qubit code.

steaneZ.qpro: Simulates the influence and detection of probabilisitc
	      phase-flip errors on a mixed density state encoded with
	      the Steane 7-qubit code.
